    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "type": "text",
        "title": "Scope, safety and interpretation",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "w": 24,
          "h": 6
        },
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "Production App Platform runtime logs for API, worker, web and save-monitor. Build/deploy logs, historical backfill and client-only events are outside this forwarding scope. Save-monitor runs every 15m; sparse logs and idle applications are normal. No generic source-silence alert is installed.\n\nIndexed scope is bounded by service and environment. OTLP severity_text and detected_level are searchable metadata. Queue/processor and opaque correlation context stay in redacted log bodies, never indexed user/bookmark/request labels. Redaction removes known credentials and private fields but cannot guarantee arbitrary free-form text is private; avoid logging private content at source.\n\nA bridge heartbeat is sent every 60s directly to OTLP. It proves bridge-to-Grafana reachability, not that any native source is connected. Counter values are process-local and reset on restart. rejectedBatches counts handler intake rejections; deliveryFailures counts failed source-batch deliveries. lastRejection reports only fixed reason, route, encoding and authenticated source categories. Health requests, native parser failures and failed heartbeat attempts are not counted. Accepted totals do not establish all-source coverage. Loki storage/ingestion charges and retention apply; consult the stack's current usage and limits.\n\n[Log forwarding runbook](https://github.com/pffreitas/cosmic-dolphin/blob/main/docs/runbooks/digitalocean-logs.md) · [Save-journey alerts and metrics](/d/cosmic-save-bookmarks)."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "type": "logs",
        "title": "Runtime logs by source",
        "description": "Choose a bounded runtime source above. Expand a row for severity metadata and redacted context. At most 500 lines per query.",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 6,
          "w": 24,
          "h": 9
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "REPLACE_LOKI_UID"
        },
        "targets": [
          {
            "refId": "A",
            "datasource": {
              "type": "loki",
              "uid": "REPLACE_LOKI_UID"
            },
            "expr": "{service_name=~\"cosmic-dolphin-api|cosmic-dolphin-worker|cosmic-dolphin-web|cosmic-dolphin-save-monitor\",deployment_environment_name=\"production\"} | service_name=~\"${source:regex}\"",
            "queryType": "range",
            "maxLines": 500
          }
        ],
        "options": {
          "showTime": true,
          "showLabels": false,
          "showCommonLabels": false,
          "wrapLogMessage": true,
          "prettifyLogMessage": false,
          "enableLogDetails": true,
          "sortOrder": "Descending",
          "dedupStrategy": "none"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "type": "logs",
        "title": "Errors and warnings",
        "description": "Severity is searched as metadata after the bounded source/environment selector.",
        "gridPos": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 15,
          "w": 12,
          "h": 9
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "REPLACE_LOKI_UID"
        },
        "targets": [
